{"id":"d6a5ff61521a8f18","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md","title":"Arithmetical Hierarchy","display":"df-arithmetical-hierarchy — Arithmetical Hierarchy","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy","aliases":["57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy"],"display":"df-arithmetical-hierarchy — Arithmetical Hierarchy","depends_on":["[[57-df-recursive-function]]","[[57-df-omega]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arithmetical-hierarchy — Arithmetical Hierarchy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3cca93ccf127333f\" href=\"?note=3cca93ccf127333f\" title=\"57-df-recursive-function\">57-df-recursive-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a630d8a1dcde994c\" href=\"?note=a630d8a1dcde994c\" title=\"57-df-omega\">57-df-omega</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"Arithmetical-Hierarchy\">Arithmetical Hierarchy</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\geq1\">\\(r\\geq1\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^r\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^r\\)</span> 以其特征函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A\">\\(\\chi_A\\)</span> 表示。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}(\\chi_A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}(\\chi_A)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3cca93ccf127333f\" href=\"?note=3cca93ccf127333f\" title=\"57-df-recursive-function\">57-df-recursive-function</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A\">\\(\\chi_A\\)</span> 本身是总函数，因此这里表达可判定性。自然数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a630d8a1dcde994c\" href=\"?note=a630d8a1dcde994c\" title=\"57-df-omega\">57-df-omega</a>。本文件的层级作用于<strong>数值关系</strong>，不与另一个文件的原始语法公式集合混同；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n^0,\\Pi_n^0,\\Delta_n^0\">\\(\\Sigma_n^0,\\Pi_n^0,\\Delta_n^0\\)</span> 是一元实例的原接口，额外下标 r 仅用于明示投影元数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A(\\vec x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&amp;\\vec x\\in A,\\\\0,&amp;\\vec x\\notin A.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\chi_A(\\vec x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&amp;\\vec x\\in A,\\\\0,&amp;\\vec x\\notin A.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{0,r}^0\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^r:\\mathrm{Rec}(\\chi_A)\\},\\qquad\\Pi_{0,r}^0\\coloneqq\\Sigma_{0,r}^0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma_{0,r}^0\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^r:\\mathrm{Rec}(\\chi_A)\\},\\qquad\\Pi_{0,r}^0\\coloneqq\\Sigma_{0,r}^0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{n+1,r}^0\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^r:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists B\\in\\Pi_{n,r+k}^0\\;\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^r\\;\n(\\vec x\\in A\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\vec y\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;(\\vec x,\\vec y)\\in B)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma_{n+1,r}^0\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^r:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists B\\in\\Pi_{n,r+k}^0\\;\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^r\\;\n(\\vec x\\in A\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\vec y\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;(\\vec x,\\vec y)\\in B)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_{n+1,r}^0\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^r:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists B\\in\\Sigma_{n,r+k}^0\\;\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^r\\;\n(\\vec x\\in A\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\vec y\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;(\\vec x,\\vec y)\\in B)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pi_{n+1,r}^0\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^r:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists B\\in\\Sigma_{n,r+k}^0\\;\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^r\\;\n(\\vec x\\in A\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\vec y\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;(\\vec x,\\vec y)\\in B)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{n,r}^0\\coloneqq\\Sigma_{n,r}^0\\cap\\Pi_{n,r}^0,\\qquad\n\\Sigma_n^0\\coloneqq\\Sigma_{n,1}^0,\\quad\\Pi_n^0\\coloneqq\\Pi_{n,1}^0,\\quad\\Delta_n^0\\coloneqq\\Delta_{n,1}^0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_{n,r}^0\\coloneqq\\Sigma_{n,r}^0\\cap\\Pi_{n,r}^0,\\qquad\n\\Sigma_n^0\\coloneqq\\Sigma_{n,1}^0,\\quad\\Pi_n^0\\coloneqq\\Pi_{n,1}^0,\\quad\\Delta_n^0\\coloneqq\\Delta_{n,1}^0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>所有初层和递推条件进入断言，投影之前的关系元数明确增加。保留数值层级以递归关系为初层的约定，不为标准化而改成别的初层。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Arithmetical-Hierarchy","text":"Arithmetical Hierarchy","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"3cca93ccf127333f","anchor":"ref-1",